    "abstract": "Parts list for the aft secondary distribution box, listing the higher rated feeder relay and the earlier support bracket standard as alternates against the ventilated box modification.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the detail parts of the aft secondary distribution box installation at the aft equipment rack, including the feeder relay and the ventilation baffle hardware.",
      "figure_note": "Item 30 and item 30A are alternates selected by the box standard: item 30 is the feeder relay qualified to the higher continuous rating used with the ventilated box, and item 30A is the support bracket used in the unventilated arrangement. The ventilation duct itself is not detailed here and is listed in the equipment rack figure. Fastener quantities are per box."
    },
